Each user story arrives as its own issue, so it can be tracked, commented on and closed on its own.

Today a plan is one long document: there is nowhere to say "this part is done" and nowhere to ask a question about one story without burying it in a thread about all of them.

The technical detail for this story — its tasks, its acceptance criteria and its architecture notes — is in [`.aiteam/lf-123-add-dry-run-to-task-clean/2026-05-20/add-dry-run-to-task-clean/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`](https://github.com/acme/acme-api/blob/9c1e0a4b7d2f8e6a5c3b1d09f8e7a6b5c4d3e2f1/.aiteam/lf-123-add-dry-run-to-task-clean/2026-05-20/add-dry-run-to-task-clean/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md).

